notes: >-
  This software is released alongside a pre-registration and a set of committed
  zero-cost provenance artifacts (ceiling.json, corpus_fraction.json,
  data.lock, power.json). The raw benchmarks it reads — LongMemEval and
  LoCoMo — are separately licensed and are not redistributed here; data.lock
  records their SHA-256 digests, byte sizes, and row counts so the committed
  artifacts remain verifiable. An ethics review is required before any use of
  LoCoMo, which contains real conversations and personal data.
